WEBVTT

00:05:26.956 --> 00:05:30.156
if you can disperse
the high-density buildings

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:32.436
with a lower-density development,

00:05:32.476 --> 00:05:36.396
you don't feel the oppressiveness
of high density.

00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:39.276
So in a new town, I plan it this way,

00:05:39.276 --> 00:05:43.316
and later, when I planned
Singapore, the whole city,

00:05:43.356 --> 00:05:45.276
I also alternate it.

00:05:45.316 --> 00:05:46.556
For example,

00:05:46.596 --> 00:05:50.836
some of the historical area
is naturally low-density,

00:05:50.876 --> 00:05:54.036
and not far from a historic area,

00:05:54.076 --> 00:05:55.356
like Shenton Way,

00:05:55.396 --> 00:05:57.396
we allow high density.

00:05:57.436 --> 00:06:00.596
But when you are in Shenton Way,
it doesn’t feel oppressive,